200 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 136 0 R
/E (Multiple devices can share the same SPI bus! Each device connects to MOSI, MISO, and SCK wires. But here's the trick: each device gets its own SS \(Slave Select\) pin. When Arduino wants to talk to a specific device, it activates that device's SS pin. This way, devices take turns talking without confusion!)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
